  "limitations": [
    "The original AAC-LC qualification corpus remains unchanged and losslessly preserved. The SBR file and real HE config previously refused by this baseline are now supported and checked against independent native results. See standalone/local-whisper-he-aac-provenance.json for full HE SBR/PS capabilities, GENERIC arithmetic profile, host variance and current unported core object types."
  ],
  "limits_historical_lc_baseline": [
    "AAC-LC (object type 2) only. Main, SSR, LTP, ER, HE-AAC/SBR/PS, LD/ELD, USAC and other object types are explicitly refused. HE-AAC is never misreported as full LC output.",
    "ADTS includes CRC-present single-block framing. Like the pinned FFmpeg decoder, the 16-bit ADTS CRC is consumed rather than checked. Protected multi-raw-block ADTS is explicitly refused; unprotected multi-block ADTS is native-compared.",
    "Clear AAC mp4a tracks only. Encrypted audio and changes between distinct sample descriptions are explicitly refused. The first audio track is selected like the original consumer.",
    "M4A/MP4 normal sample tables and fragments, 32/64-bit offsets, compact sample sizes, edit lists, delayed initialization, iTunSMPB and libfaac delay are handled. The native decoder does not truncate the final frame solely to packet duration; that behavior is preserved.",
    "The pinned decoder rejects explicit frequency index 15, even for a canonical rate; this rejection is retained.",
    "FFmpeg remaps PCE tags to dense internal identifiers before CCE target matching. Its actual mapping behavior, including arbitrary tags and default non-strict 7.1 channel assumptions, is preserved and independently tested.",
    "The scalar mathematical FFT differs in last float rounding from native SIMD AVTX. Golden file max float error is 2.384185791015625e-7 and golden raw-tool max is 4.76837158203125e-7; test bound is 2e-6. Output remains original planar float before SWR, not pre-quantized S16.",
    "Malformed/truncated data is rejected, including some inputs native FFmpeg conceals or resynchronizes. Native error or concealment outcomes are retained for each invalid fixture.",
    "max_frames and max_seconds bound per-channel output and raw decoder samples, with one second plus two frames of pre-roll allowance. Repeated libfaac delay metadata cannot bypass the raw work budget.",
    "Independent file and numerical fixtures do not alone claim completion of the original Faster-Whisper/CT2 transcription consumer; the audio facade integration and consumer validation are separate.",
    "External FFmpeg sample audio was read only for authoring verification. Only its public header metadata/ASC and hash receipts are retained here; external copyrighted audio is not redistributed in these fixtures."
  ],
